  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LIDEMA Climate Adaptation, CS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LIDEMA Climate Adaptation, CS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Definition and implementation of locally based and prioritized        activities related to the need for climate adaptation, through the    environmental network LIDEMA and its base organizations.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Definition och genomf&#xf6;rande av lokalt baserade aktiviteter inom       prioriterade omr&#xe5;den f&#xf6;r klimatanpassning, via det nationella         milj&#xf6;n&#xe4;tverket LIDEMA och dess basorganisationer.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop and validate replicable measures for reduction of livelihood vulnerabilities due to climate change at the grass-roots level and to strengthen local organisations and administrative levels for enhancing their capacity to assume responsibility for planning for efforts to adapt to climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
